<title>JAPAN: Kitakyushu Coca-Cola -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kitakyushu Coca-Cola -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 46.61		vs	   44.92</p>
<p> Operating	    4.59		vs	    4.31</p>
<p> Current		4.87		vs	    4.51</p>
<p> Net		    2.66		vs	    2.36</p>
<p> EPS		   60.78 yen	  vs	   59.52 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     44 million	  vs	  40 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 13.50 yen	  vs	   12.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kitakyushu Coca-Cola Bottling Co Ltd is a Coca-Cola bottler based in Fukuoka.</p>
</text>
